:"王阮","text":"忌口年来积渐除，君王方信是真儒。\n稍移全活一州手，再使江西十郡苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14983,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其六","author":"王阮","text":"移苗时节雨连天，白水青秧满大田。\n天欲先生归去后，故留遗爱在丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14984,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其五","author":"王阮","text":"去年民食十分灾，一力先生尽救回。\n今日手攀辕下者，人人都自翳桑来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14985,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其四","author":"王阮","text":"灵台一似大圆镜，妍丑自分吾不知。\n秋杀春生天道尔，先生喜怒一何私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14986,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其三","author":"王阮","text":"武夷山下孤高节，五老亭中抚字心。\n出处本来无二致，讵分钟鼎与山林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14987,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其二","author":"王阮","text":"渊泉溥博与天大，土苴绪馀聊觉民。\n千古濂溪好风月，一回拈出一回新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14988,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晦翁十首 其一","author":"王阮","text":"精微元不在河汾，原道词雄亦浅闻。\n自得正心诚意论，始知天未丧斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14989,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重九再到张已隔世书诗牌后一首","author":"王阮","text":"碧纱笼底墨才乾，白玉楼中骨已寒。\n泪尽当年联骑客，菊花时节独来看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14990,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别昌国五首 其五","author":"王阮","text":"扶桑曾见日腾空，老去归田不复东。\n一觉短檐他日梦，起来惆怅晓窗红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14991,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别昌国五首 其四","author":"王阮","text":"当时底事乞身归，万物何曾与我违。\n最是临行更肠断，海鸥犹自掠船飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14992,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别昌国五首 其三","author":"王阮","text":"三山月淡白银阙，九老春闲紫石宫。\n此去能争几多地，恨无仙骨到其中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14993,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别昌国五首 其二","author":"王阮","text":"全家虽脱海波危，旧治无人咏十奇。\n孤奉明恩颜似甲，却嗔儿女笑嘻嘻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14994,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别昌国五首 其一","author":"王阮","text":"妄意弦歌学子游，迄无三异比中牟。\n丁宁今夜东风雨，添起潮头急去休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14995,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范石湖五首 其五","author":"王阮","text":"彭泽归来我自安，壶中尤觉太虚宽。\n世间万事都忘尽，只有公盟不敢寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14996,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范石湖五首 其四","author":"王阮","text":"近来能辟千年谷，归去非思一箸鲈。\n聊示维摩隐几相，要教狮子致文殊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14997,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范石湖五首 其三","author":"王阮","text":"湖山奔辏黛眉攒，湖水晶荧镜面寒。\n补衮之丝元未尽，西风吹上钓鱼竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14998,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范石湖五首 其二","author":"王阮","text":"银山铁垒洞庭秋，又见鸱夷一叶舟。\n且是云仍高一著，祗将山水事清游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14999,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范石湖五首 其一","author":"王阮","text":"殊庭诏禄佚忠勤，秘殿升班宠旧勋。\n试向午桥诸第问，有谁别墅得奎文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15000,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄宫一首","author":"王阮","text":"洞天若限仙凡路，九锁前山不易寻。\n尚有康庐山下客，玉皇温诏与登临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15001,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖南道中三首 其三","author":"王阮","text":"万壑千岩我一家，别来空自锁烟霞。\n闲云不放行人望，故向东南角上遮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15002,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖南道中三首 其二","author":"王阮","text":"已分馀生老一丘，尚因微禄少迟留。\n梦魂不待山资足，先入江南问钓舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15003,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖南道中三首 其一","author":"王阮","text":"失脚南来又两年，故山猿鹤祇凄然。\n潇湘不是无佳景，终觉壶中别有天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15004,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登衡岳三首 其三","author":"王阮","text":"绝境当须著好词，衰怀已觉不胜奇。\n烦君试向仙家问，怕有弥明更解诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15005,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登衡岳三首 其二","author":"王阮","text":"白衣苍狗飞扬尽，翠巘苍崖杖屦间。\n独到上封雷雨处，退之元未识衡山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15006,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登衡岳三首 其一","author":"王阮","text":"膻羊腥犬沸中原，五岳之中四岳昏。\n节义衡山独不辱，万年千载戴明恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15007,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遇流民有感一首","author":"王阮","text":"行尽江南处处山，无钱归去买山闲。\n自怜不在施为地，空对流民数汗颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15008,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]